    "notes": {
        "8c2404e4-69f3-4191-b4b7-ee3ac6353ede": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 640,
            "width": 900,
            "height": 260,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe trigger and the upload are both scoped to `E2E-Delta-Triggers/NewFile` in the **Documents** library of the\n**Stg Appmixer QA** SharePoint site. That folder must exist — create it with\n`appmixer.microsoft.sharepoint.CreateFolder` (parent path `E2E-Delta-Triggers`) on a fresh tenant.\n\nScoping matters: cleanup deletes the item id the trigger reported, so nothing other than this\nflow may write text files into that folder while the flow runs.\n\n`Wait 1m` before the upload lets the Microsoft Graph subscription propagate — do not remove it.\nGraph webhook notifications take up to ~5 minutes, hence the 600 s AfterAll timeout.\n\nThe account needs `Files.Read.All`, `Sites.Read.All`, `Subscription.Read.All` (trigger),\n`Files.ReadWrite.All` (upload) and `Sites.ReadWrite.All` (cleanup Make API Call)."
        }
